#: ../../004_cli_tool.md:107
msgid "Validation Strictness"
msgstr ""

#: ../../004_cli_tool.md:109
msgid ""
"Script validation follows a **strict schema contract**. The validator "
"rejects any deviation from the defined schema:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../004_cli_tool.md:111
msgid ""
"**Unknown top-level fields → error**: Only `version`, `context`, and "
"`steps` are allowed at the top level. Any other field will cause "
"validation to fail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../004_cli_tool.md:113
msgid ""
"**Unknown context fields → error**: Only the documented context fields "
"are allowed. Unknown fields in the `context` section will cause "
"validation to fail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../004_cli_tool.md:115
msgid ""
"**Unknown step types → error**: Only `process` and `sleep` are valid step"
" types. Any other step type will cause validation to fail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../004_cli_tool.md:117
msgid ""
"**Unknown step fields → error**: Each step type has a defined set of "
"allowed fields. Any field not explicitly documented for that step type "
"will cause validation to fail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../004_cli_tool.md:119
msgid ""
"**Extra keys in nested structures → error**: Nested structures (like "
"`upload` in `process` steps, or `overrides`) only accept their documented"
" fields. Unknown keys will cause validation to fail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../004_cli_tool.md:121
msgid ""
"**Order matters**: Steps are executed sequentially in the exact order "
"they appear in the `steps` list. The execution order is significant and "
"cannot be changed."
msgstr ""

